<title>FINLAND: Baltic Ice - Three icebreakers near St Petersburg.</title>
<headline>Baltic Ice - Three icebreakers near St Petersburg.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fast ice gathered around Parnu and between 58 and 59 degrees north with three icebreakers on station near St Petersburg and Vyborg, the Finnish Institute of Marine Research said on Monday.</p>
<p>But in its twice-weekly report the institute specified no further navigation restrictons planned.</p>
<p>Three icebreakers were on station in the extreme north of the Gulf of Bothnia near Oulu, Kemi and Lulea, it said.</p>
<p>(Temperatures of nearby isotherms, degrees Celsius)</p>
